    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "In Figure 3-9, the optical distance between Storwize V7000 Node 1 and Host 2 is slightly over 40 km (24.85 miles)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 67,
