    "bounding box" : [ 135.667, 130.667, 547.333, 158.0 ],
    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "To avoid latencies that lead to degraded performance, avoid ISL hops whenever possible. In an optimal setup, the servers connect to the same SAN switch as the Storwize V7000 nodes."
